<title>UK: ING Bank sets $250 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>ING Bank sets $250 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager PaineWebber.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ING BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    21.MAR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.925   PAY DATE    21.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.75     SPREAD	+8 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX/AMST  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  1.175     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
